To benchmark on Centaurus
1. Pull Git repository
2. run "make" in the "mergesort_task" directory to compile the code
3. run the batch script to execute the code through slurm. Use the following rules:

    Use the following arguments to run on command line:
    sbatch batch_script.sh <n> <nbthreads> 

4. The execution time will be listed at the bottom of the .out file that is generated after execution

